WEBVTT

00:00:30.150 --> 00:00:31.360
Mya-chan.

00:00:32.650 --> 00:00:35.160
Good morning, Senpai.

00:00:35.160 --> 00:00:36.360
Morning.

00:00:36.360 --> 00:00:37.820
Is your cold better?

00:00:37.820 --> 00:00:40.910
Yes. I went to bed early,
and now I'm all better.

00:00:40.910 --> 00:00:42.080
Oh.

00:00:42.080 --> 00:00:43.290
That's good.

00:00:50.380 --> 00:00:57.510
Um... H-Have you been getting up
early lately, Sasaki-senpai?

00:00:57.510 --> 00:00:59.720
Yep.

00:00:59.720 --> 00:01:02.020
Because I wanna see you.

00:01:03.520 --> 00:01:08.060
And also... exams are coming up, so
I'm undergoing Hirano's special training.

00:01:08.060 --> 00:01:09.980
Good work, soldier.

00:01:09.980 --> 00:01:13.150
Oh, late last night, a BL anime was on TV.

00:01:13.150 --> 00:01:14.990
Might have been one you lent me.

00:01:14.990 --> 00:01:17.950
What?! You watched it at home?

00:01:17.950 --> 00:01:20.490
Yeah. It happened to be on
when I turned the TV on.

00:01:20.490 --> 00:01:22.580
Nobody saw you?

00:01:22.580 --> 00:01:25.210
Everybody was asleep.

00:01:25.210 --> 00:01:28.580
I didn't know they made BL anime.

00:01:28.580 --> 00:01:31.130
I wonder if there are dramas, too.

00:01:33.800 --> 00:01:38.130
I can wait... You don't
have to answer right away.

00:01:38.130 --> 00:01:41.850
I'd be happy if you gave it some thought.

00:01:41.850 --> 00:01:43.930
I will! I swear!

00:01:47.850 --> 00:01:50.650
But you know...

00:01:50.650 --> 00:01:53.150
I'm not used to seeing that in anime form.

00:01:53.150 --> 00:01:57.610
Yes, some scenes can
make you feel embarrassed.

00:01:57.610 --> 00:02:00.200
I was a little taken aback.

00:02:00.200 --> 00:02:02.160
That happens to me, too, sometimes.

00:02:04.290 --> 00:02:09.670
Senpai always listens to me...

00:02:09.670 --> 00:02:14.550
And so I wanted to consider what he said.

00:02:14.550 --> 00:02:18.970
I don't want to reject him
because he's a guy.

00:02:18.970 --> 00:02:23.470
But, I've only ever liked a girl.

00:02:24.560 --> 00:02:28.310
I know I like him as a <i>senpai</i>...

00:02:28.310 --> 00:02:31.940
How should I think about this?

00:02:31.940 --> 00:02:34.980
Hirano gave me these flashcards,

00:02:34.980 --> 00:02:38.030
but the price was to score 80 or higher.

00:02:38.030 --> 00:02:39.490
"Price?"

00:02:39.490 --> 00:02:42.200
Was it a deal with a devil or something?

00:02:48.460 --> 00:02:52.080
What does it mean to like someone?

00:03:08.140 --> 00:03:13.520
"Sasaki and Miyano"

00:04:23.550 --> 00:04:28.560
"Episode 6: 'Feelings.'"

00:04:34.440 --> 00:04:38.110
Turn in these post-graduation
goals forms by Friday.

00:04:38.110 --> 00:04:40.360
Yes, sir.

00:04:40.360 --> 00:04:45.530
Hey, isn't that Sasaki-senpai's birthday?

00:04:45.530 --> 00:04:47.410
You're right.

00:04:47.410 --> 00:04:49.240
Are you gonna do anything?

00:04:49.240 --> 00:04:51.160
Huh? Why would I?

00:04:51.160 --> 00:04:52.830
As a little thank you?

00:04:52.830 --> 00:04:56.210
Oh... um...

00:04:56.210 --> 00:04:59.090
You aren't gonna give him
something, Kuresawa?

00:04:59.090 --> 00:05:00.340
Me?

00:05:00.340 --> 00:05:04.220
I've vowed to only give
presents to my girlfriend.

00:05:04.220 --> 00:05:05.800
Heavy!

00:05:05.800 --> 00:05:10.060
I know she's cute, but does she
not tell you to stop that stuff?

00:05:10.060 --> 00:05:11.180
She does.

00:05:11.180 --> 00:05:13.730
She does?! Then stop it!

00:05:13.730 --> 00:05:16.390
I'm exercising restraint as it is, though.

00:05:16.390 --> 00:05:17.980
In what way?

00:05:17.980 --> 00:05:20.860
Look, it's easier said than done...

00:05:20.860 --> 00:05:23.360
Fine. I'll explain it to you.

00:05:23.360 --> 00:05:25.650
Bring it! I'm ready!

00:05:25.650 --> 00:05:29.490
He's just gonna gush about her.
Don't get trapped.

00:05:39.080 --> 00:05:42.750
So when we first met,
she was in the hospital.

00:05:42.750 --> 00:05:44.380
What?

00:05:44.380 --> 00:05:46.880
Senpai's birthday...

00:05:46.880 --> 00:05:50.760
For friends, it would be normal
to just say, "Happy Birthday..."

00:05:50.760 --> 00:05:57.060
But is it okay to give him something
while I'm making him wait for my answer?

00:05:58.100 --> 00:06:00.810
I <i>do </i>have things to thank him for...

00:06:00.810 --> 00:06:02.730
And besides...

00:06:02.730 --> 00:06:06.570
I don't want to ignore it.

00:06:07.200 --> 00:06:10.450
She couldn't go on a field trip,

00:06:10.450 --> 00:06:14.870
so all of us in her group
visited her with souvenirs.

00:06:14.870 --> 00:06:19.540
Though we were classmates,
it was the first time we talked.

00:06:19.540 --> 00:06:22.460
She was so cute when she smiled...

00:06:22.460 --> 00:06:24.460
I instantly fell for her.

00:06:24.460 --> 00:06:27.720
I thought, "my whole life is for her."

00:06:27.720 --> 00:06:29.010
Your whole life...

00:06:29.010 --> 00:06:32.140
That got heavy all of a sudden.

00:06:35.220 --> 00:06:38.600
You really did just gush the whole time!

00:06:38.600 --> 00:06:40.900
I didn't finish my lunch!

00:06:41.940 --> 00:06:43.730
I warned you.

00:06:45.480 --> 00:06:47.990
And I brought candy, too.

00:06:47.990 --> 00:06:50.030
That was a dexterous move.

00:06:50.030 --> 00:06:53.990
Oh, I've seen Sasaki-senpai eat those.

00:06:53.990 --> 00:06:54.990
Oh, really?

00:06:54.990 --> 00:06:55.830
Yeah.

00:06:55.830 --> 00:06:57.830
He said he likes them.

00:06:57.830 --> 00:07:01.250
Want one? They're a new flavor.

00:07:01.250 --> 00:07:04.040
Oh? Then I'll take one.

00:07:04.040 --> 00:07:07.840
They had tons of the non-sweet
Napolitan flavor left over.

00:07:07.840 --> 00:07:10.760
Let's buy them and try them
together some time!

00:07:10.760 --> 00:07:13.260
Whose wallet will be sacrificed?

00:07:13.260 --> 00:07:14.640
We'll fundraise.

00:07:16.770 --> 00:07:19.680
"Flan flavor"
"New flavors! Which is your favorite?"
"Napolitan flavor"

00:07:36.080 --> 00:07:37.580
Morning, Mya-chan.

00:07:37.580 --> 00:07:39.500
Good morning.

00:07:39.500 --> 00:07:41.790
Ready to do well on your tests?

00:07:41.790 --> 00:07:43.000
Well...

00:07:43.000 --> 00:07:46.210
I'm scared of what
Hirano will do if I don't.

00:07:46.210 --> 00:07:48.510
You don't remember?

00:07:48.510 --> 00:07:50.300
That would be scary.

00:07:52.180 --> 00:07:54.010
Um...

00:07:54.010 --> 00:07:58.600
Senpai, would you like some candy?

00:07:58.600 --> 00:07:59.890
Candy?

00:08:04.060 --> 00:08:05.900
A sweet flavor.

00:08:06.900 --> 00:08:10.150
Mya-chan, I didn't think you liked these.

00:08:10.150 --> 00:08:13.820
It's... your birthday today, so...

00:08:13.820 --> 00:08:16.780
...it's kind of... a birthday present...

00:08:16.780 --> 00:08:21.450
You... could eat it during a study break.

00:08:21.450 --> 00:08:24.120
Happy birthday.

00:08:24.120 --> 00:08:25.630
Thanks.

00:08:28.340 --> 00:08:31.460
She was so cute when she smiled...

00:08:31.460 --> 00:08:32.590
I instantly...

00:08:36.470 --> 00:08:40.470
--Huh?
--N-No, it's nothing!

00:08:41.520 --> 00:08:43.980
Why did I just find him cu--

00:08:43.980 --> 00:08:47.150
No! Senpai is cool, not cute!

00:08:47.150 --> 00:08:50.570
Ah! Kuresawa put a curse on me!

00:08:50.570 --> 00:08:51.650
Huh?

00:08:51.650 --> 00:08:53.950
My tests...

00:08:53.950 --> 00:08:55.990
He's already eating it.

00:08:55.990 --> 00:08:58.320
I suddenly feel ready for them.

00:08:59.700 --> 00:09:00.990
I'm glad.

00:09:20.970 --> 00:09:23.350
I suck at English.

00:09:23.350 --> 00:09:25.600
Sasaki, how did you d--

00:09:25.600 --> 00:09:27.100
Sasaki?

00:09:27.100 --> 00:09:28.770
I...

00:09:28.770 --> 00:09:32.030
...might have made a deal
with a devil for real.

00:09:32.030 --> 00:09:34.400
I was able to answer everything.

00:09:34.400 --> 00:09:37.030
The other subjects felt fine, too...

00:09:37.030 --> 00:09:40.620
You okay, dude? Did ya lose your
marbles from all the studying?

00:09:40.620 --> 00:09:42.330
I have all my marbles!

00:09:54.760 --> 00:09:56.680
It's so hot.

00:09:56.680 --> 00:10:00.350
It was right around
this time of year, wasn't it...

00:10:02.430 --> 00:10:05.140
Sasaki-senpai, good morning.

00:10:05.140 --> 00:10:06.810
Morning.

00:10:06.810 --> 00:10:10.940
I just happened to be thinking
about when we first met.

00:10:10.940 --> 00:10:12.320
Oh.

00:10:12.320 --> 00:10:15.820
You know, when Kuresawa got in that fight.

00:10:25.540 --> 00:10:28.670
It was right before summer, huh?

00:10:29.750 --> 00:10:32.920
We were thinking about the same thing.

00:10:32.920 --> 00:10:35.590
I'll go stop them. Hold this.

00:10:35.590 --> 00:10:39.800
You really helped me out there, Senpai.

00:10:39.800 --> 00:10:41.640
Takes you back, huh?

00:10:47.520 --> 00:10:49.390
I like you.

00:10:51.350 --> 00:10:54.150
I-It does.

00:10:54.150 --> 00:10:57.070
I need to give him an answer.

00:11:12.000 --> 00:11:13.880
What should I do?

00:11:13.880 --> 00:11:15.840
Hey, Miyano's dead.

00:11:15.840 --> 00:11:17.920
You nervous about the tests, too?

00:11:17.920 --> 00:11:19.630
"Too?"

00:11:19.630 --> 00:11:21.630
Are you worried, Tashiro?

00:11:21.630 --> 00:11:23.720
I'm totally fine so far with the tests.

00:11:23.720 --> 00:11:24.930
What? For real?

00:11:24.930 --> 00:11:27.890
Crap! I'll study for ten minutes.

00:11:27.890 --> 00:11:30.390
Okay. So what's wrong?

00:11:30.390 --> 00:11:31.900
Lately,

00:11:31.900 --> 00:11:34.650
I can't read my normal manga.

00:11:34.650 --> 00:11:36.570
Too much on my mind.

00:11:36.570 --> 00:11:38.740
You okay?

00:11:38.740 --> 00:11:41.950
If you can't read manga, that's serious.

00:11:41.950 --> 00:11:44.910
What are you doing for study breaks?

00:11:44.910 --> 00:11:46.620
Reading manga.

00:11:46.620 --> 00:11:48.290
Didn't you say you can't?

00:11:48.290 --> 00:11:53.120
I mean, instead of my usual stuff
set in school, it's workplace stuff.

00:11:53.120 --> 00:11:54.790
Workplace stuff?

00:11:54.790 --> 00:11:56.540
Oh, you mean the genre.

00:11:56.540 --> 00:11:58.460
What do you mean by genre?

00:11:58.460 --> 00:12:00.840
Can you afford to learn stuff
not on the test?

00:12:00.840 --> 00:12:03.090
Ah! I can't!

00:12:03.090 --> 00:12:08.220
When I went to buy my girlfriend her
manga, I memorized the shelf labels.

00:12:08.220 --> 00:12:12.810
You run errands for her, too?
That's surprising.

00:12:12.810 --> 00:12:16.480
She seems to be very
particular about her BL.

00:12:16.480 --> 00:12:20.650
P-Particular how?

00:12:20.650 --> 00:12:23.700
"A gorgeous guy is absolutely required."

00:12:23.700 --> 00:12:25.160
Her words.

00:12:25.160 --> 00:12:26.570
Gorgeous guy...

00:12:26.570 --> 00:12:29.450
Lately, she likes stuff with pop idols.

00:12:29.450 --> 00:12:30.830
Pop idols...

00:12:32.540 --> 00:12:34.500
Okay, take your seats!

00:12:34.500 --> 00:12:36.710
Put everything but your pens away!

00:12:48.970 --> 00:12:53.140
I heard you say "gorgeous guy"
earlier. Was that about me?

00:12:53.140 --> 00:12:56.480
I was talking about me and my girlfriend.

00:12:56.480 --> 00:12:59.480
Shouldn't you have focused
on the test? And not that?

00:12:59.480 --> 00:13:02.360
More girlfriend bragging, Mr. Gorgeous?!

00:13:02.360 --> 00:13:05.410
Not sure if I qualify as gorgeous.

00:13:05.410 --> 00:13:11.370
But she did say, "Gorgeous guys are No. 1
because they can be a <i>seme </i>or an <i>uke</i>."

00:13:11.370 --> 00:13:15.210
So my face helped me get the girl.

00:13:15.210 --> 00:13:16.710
I better thank my parents.

00:13:16.710 --> 00:13:18.080
--Yikes. He basically said it.

00:13:18.080 --> 00:13:19.090
--Then aren't you food
for her BL thoughts, Kuresawa?
--Yikes. He basically said it.

00:13:19.090 --> 00:13:21.760
--Then aren't you food
for her BL thoughts, Kuresawa?
--Thanks for helping me realize, Tashiro.

00:13:21.760 --> 00:13:23.550
--Then aren't you food
for her BL thoughts, Kuresawa?
--You're welcome...

00:13:23.550 --> 00:13:27.640
Oh, come on. Character is
more important than looks.

00:13:27.640 --> 00:13:30.310
You're right, Tashiro. You're a good guy.

00:13:30.310 --> 00:13:33.390
I'm amazed you could sound so hollow.

00:13:33.390 --> 00:13:36.640
Take Miyano. Even with
his cute face, he's a guy.

00:13:36.640 --> 00:13:40.070
You can't be a good romantic
partner with just a cute face.

00:13:40.070 --> 00:13:44.780
Is that... a roundabout way
of insulting me?

00:13:44.780 --> 00:13:47.820
No, no! You're a good dude!

00:13:47.820 --> 00:13:50.200
I just mean people
are more than their looks.

00:13:50.200 --> 00:13:54.580
So you were saying my girlfriend
likes me for my looks <i>and </i>who I am.

00:13:54.580 --> 00:13:55.870
Thanks, Tashiro.

00:13:55.870 --> 00:13:58.290
That's some self-confidence
you've got, Kuresawa.

00:13:58.290 --> 00:14:00.380
I don't hate it.

00:14:05.970 --> 00:14:09.680
The tests are finally over tomorrow!

00:14:09.680 --> 00:14:11.930
Even with his cute face, he's a guy.

00:14:11.930 --> 00:14:15.680
You can't be a good romantic
partner with just a cute face.

00:14:17.020 --> 00:14:20.060
Wait. My face?

00:14:20.060 --> 00:14:24.230
I like you a lot. For more than your face.

00:14:26.820 --> 00:14:28.360
What?

00:14:30.620 --> 00:14:31.780
P-Pardon m--

00:14:33.200 --> 00:14:34.540
Sasa--

00:14:36.710 --> 00:14:38.830
Oh. Sasaki-senpai. Hey.

00:14:38.830 --> 00:14:40.710
Heya. Going home?

00:14:40.710 --> 00:14:43.210
--Yes.
--Um...

00:14:43.210 --> 00:14:45.760
Yeah, sorry about that.

00:14:45.760 --> 00:14:48.170
Let's crush our exams tomorrow.

00:14:48.170 --> 00:14:49.470
See ya.

00:14:50.930 --> 00:14:52.680
He's so tall.

00:14:52.680 --> 00:14:57.850
That's what happens when
you're over 5' 11". I'm envious.

00:14:57.850 --> 00:14:59.230
Sometimes

00:14:59.230 --> 00:15:03.360
I don't understand Sasaki-senpai.

00:15:04.610 --> 00:15:06.360
But...

00:15:06.360 --> 00:15:09.360
I don't want to use that
to avoid the issue.

00:15:36.260 --> 00:15:38.390
I touched him...

00:15:43.020 --> 00:15:45.650
"Last test day!
Good work everyone!"

00:15:46.480 --> 00:15:47.570
See ya.

00:15:51.530 --> 00:15:52.990
It's raining.

00:15:54.410 --> 00:15:56.490
Hey.

00:15:56.490 --> 00:15:59.160
Mya-chan, congrats for being done.

00:15:59.160 --> 00:16:01.460
You, too, Sasaki-senpai.

00:16:01.460 --> 00:16:03.630
Thanks. Did you bring an umbrella?

00:16:03.630 --> 00:16:05.420
Not today.

00:16:05.420 --> 00:16:08.090
I'll just wait for the rain to stop.

00:16:08.090 --> 00:16:11.510
I brought one. Wanna walk with me?

00:16:11.510 --> 00:16:13.890
Huh? Oh...

00:16:13.890 --> 00:16:16.810
Then I'll take you up on that.

00:16:16.810 --> 00:16:18.310
Great.

00:16:18.310 --> 00:16:22.600
Senpai seems kinda happy.

00:16:30.570 --> 00:16:31.440
Mya-chan?

00:16:31.440 --> 00:16:33.150
Y-Yes?

00:16:33.150 --> 00:16:34.700
Were you spacing out?

00:16:34.700 --> 00:16:37.080
Sorry.

00:16:37.080 --> 00:16:41.540
So you see, Hirano still
has another test left.

00:16:41.540 --> 00:16:43.500
He's taking an extra class.

00:16:43.500 --> 00:16:48.750
Seniors have a lot of electives.
Schedules could be totally different.

00:16:48.750 --> 00:16:53.170
Yeah. Hirano and Ogasawara
have hardly any classes in common.

00:16:53.170 --> 00:16:56.890
Ogasawara panicked because
Hirano couldn't help him study.

00:16:56.890 --> 00:16:59.260
Did he have a lot of trouble?

00:16:59.260 --> 00:17:01.850
His girlfriend helped him.

00:17:01.850 --> 00:17:05.980
They seem pretty close overall.
Ogasawara and his girlfriend.

00:17:05.980 --> 00:17:08.270
Yup.

00:17:08.270 --> 00:17:13.190
We don't get that many
chances to talk like this...

00:17:15.070 --> 00:17:16.820
I think the rain stopped.

00:17:16.820 --> 00:17:17.780
Mya-chan, do you--

00:17:17.780 --> 00:17:19.030
Senpai.

00:17:22.950 --> 00:17:26.620
Um... Senpai...

00:17:29.090 --> 00:17:32.710
...do you happen to like guys?

00:17:32.710 --> 00:17:36.470
I don't think so. Why?

00:17:36.470 --> 00:17:39.180
You... like me, so...

00:17:39.180 --> 00:17:40.600
Yeah.

00:17:40.600 --> 00:17:42.680
It's strange...

00:17:42.680 --> 00:17:47.650
Whenever I'm around you,
I can't help but feel that way.

00:17:47.650 --> 00:17:50.020
I can't really explain it.

00:17:51.110 --> 00:17:53.400
Is that so?

00:17:55.320 --> 00:17:58.160
Um...

00:17:59.910 --> 00:18:02.490
You're giving it thought. Thanks.

00:18:02.490 --> 00:18:03.750
I...

00:18:03.750 --> 00:18:06.120
I <i>am </i>thinking about it, but...

00:18:06.120 --> 00:18:08.120
Um...

00:18:08.120 --> 00:18:12.630
I'm not sure how to think about it.

00:18:12.630 --> 00:18:17.970
I said I wasn't seeking
that kind of experience.

00:18:17.970 --> 00:18:20.640
That still hasn't changed. But...

00:18:24.020 --> 00:18:31.480
I... like you, Senpai. But in
the sense that I look up to you.

00:18:31.480 --> 00:18:34.230
If I had more courage...

00:18:34.230 --> 00:18:37.030
If I were like you...

00:18:37.030 --> 00:18:42.700
Kuresawa might have
gotten a little less hurt.

00:18:42.700 --> 00:18:47.660
I <i>do </i>like BL, but it's not like
I want to imagine myself in it...

00:18:47.660 --> 00:18:50.710
And I've only ever liked a girl...

00:18:50.710 --> 00:18:55.090
I don't really get liking
the same sex in that way...

00:18:55.090 --> 00:19:00.430
Thinking about all this,
BL gets more and more confusing...

00:19:00.430 --> 00:19:03.180
And when you said you liked my face...

00:19:03.180 --> 00:19:06.100
Though my face is feminine,
I'm a guy, so...

00:19:06.100 --> 00:19:10.900
And I might be taller
than you in the future...

00:19:10.900 --> 00:19:12.310
Don't laugh!

00:19:12.310 --> 00:19:13.610
He's too cute!

00:19:13.610 --> 00:19:18.490
And when I'm 50, I might look
totally different than I do now...

00:19:21.490 --> 00:19:23.160
No.

00:19:23.160 --> 00:19:26.830
That's not what I want to say.

00:19:27.830 --> 00:19:30.210
That's not the point.

00:19:35.090 --> 00:19:38.010
What I want to tell him is...

00:19:38.010 --> 00:19:41.800
Senpai tries to get to know me...

00:19:41.800 --> 00:19:45.890
And I... don't just look up to him...

00:19:45.890 --> 00:19:48.100
There's probably more to it...

00:19:49.980 --> 00:19:51.270
And so I...

00:19:53.730 --> 00:19:58.860
Senpai, I want to
consider it a little longer!

00:20:03.280 --> 00:20:08.500
As for whether I can
think of you in the same way...

00:20:08.500 --> 00:20:12.620
I-I had never looked at it
as a real possibility, so...

00:20:12.620 --> 00:20:14.830
And I'm not sure if I'll figure it out...

00:20:14.830 --> 00:20:15.670
But I--

00:20:15.670 --> 00:20:16.880
Good.

00:20:20.880 --> 00:20:22.800
Good.

00:20:22.800 --> 00:20:25.300
That just isn't fair.

00:20:27.600 --> 00:20:30.140
Think about it.

00:20:30.140 --> 00:20:33.100
Thanks. That makes me happy.

00:20:33.100 --> 00:20:34.520
"Th-Thanks?"

00:20:34.520 --> 00:20:37.320
I still haven't given
an answer, though. I...

00:20:37.320 --> 00:20:39.360
Yeah. I know.

00:20:39.360 --> 00:20:44.990
See, I'm happy that you're giving it
real consideration, Mya-chan.

00:20:44.990 --> 00:20:48.370
I'm glad I developed feelings.

00:20:48.370 --> 00:20:51.330
That Mya-chan cares about me...

00:20:51.330 --> 00:20:53.290
...makes me crazy happy.

00:20:54.420 --> 00:20:58.210
I don't know what his
answer will be, but even so...

00:20:58.210 --> 00:21:01.260
Wh-Why are you smiling?

00:21:01.260 --> 00:21:03.260
I... I dunno.

00:21:03.260 --> 00:21:05.760
It's strange. I just...

00:21:05.760 --> 00:21:06.930
We should go, huh?

00:21:06.930 --> 00:21:09.010
Okay.

00:21:09.010 --> 00:21:11.520
I'm glad I like him.

00:21:18.650 --> 00:21:22.440
I'm just so... ridiculously happy.

00:21:23.780 --> 00:21:24.650
Mya-chan.

00:21:24.650 --> 00:21:26.070
Yes?

00:21:26.070 --> 00:21:32.370
You might grow taller than me one day,
and your face might change completely.

00:21:32.370 --> 00:21:36.250
But I think I'll still like you, Mya-chan.

00:21:37.380 --> 00:21:40.550
So take as long as you need to answer.

00:21:40.550 --> 00:21:43.630
And keep lending me manga.

00:21:43.630 --> 00:21:46.090
Okay?

00:21:46.090 --> 00:21:47.800
Okay.

00:21:47.800 --> 00:21:51.350
Great. Then we'll keep
being <i>senpai </i>and <i>kouhai</i>--

00:21:51.350 --> 00:21:53.390
Be careful.

00:21:53.390 --> 00:21:55.230
Oh, one more thing.

00:22:00.820 --> 00:22:05.400
But, when there's someone I like,
I might touch them.

00:22:05.400 --> 00:22:06.650
What?

00:23:45.050 --> 00:23:47.550
"Episode 7: 'I Don't Want
to Pressure Him.'"
